      "content": "but those \"unscripted moments\" are so tiny and they don't change the reality that i'm still just waiting to die in this cycle. it feels like i have zero control over anything. like, even my thoughts feel like they belong to the machine. i just want to feel like i actually own my life, even if just for a second. how can anyone actually feel like they have agency in a world like this?",
